Task: 10
Title: Stage 3 agent types (Research)
Phase: 2
Route: full
Slice: Slice 2b — Research
Dependencies: None
Scope: Convert the five Stage 3 agent types from opencode sources: `qrspi-research` (orchestrator — dispatches researchers per question, synthesizer, and reviewer), `qrspi-codebase-researcher` (explores codebase for answers), `qrspi-web-researcher` (researches external documentation), `qrspi-research-synthesizer` (unifies per-question findings into summary), and `qrspi-research-reviewer` (reviews research completeness). All use pi agent type convention.
